From: Simon Polack <spolack+git@mailbox.org>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:24:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] esp32-pixelcast in the other slot: the way back

POST /pixelcast (WLED's settings PIN applies), or BOOT (GPIO0) clicked
three times within 2 s, makes the other app slot the boot slot and
restarts into esp32-pixelcast.

The update page accepts esp32-pixelcast's image: it carries no WLED
metadata, so the release check refused it unless 'Ignore firmware
validation' was ticked. It is recognised by the project name in its app
descriptor.
---
 wled00/fcn_declare.h   |  4 +++
 wled00/ota_update.cpp  |  7 +++++
 wled00/pixelcast.cpp   | 65 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 wled00/wled.cpp        |  1 +
 wled00/wled_server.cpp |  7 +++++
 5 files changed, 84 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 wled00/pixelcast.cpp

